    "steps": [
      "Crack the eggs into a medium bowl.",
      "Whisk the milk and starch together in a cup until no lumps remain.",
      "Pour the starch mixture into the bowl of eggs, beat everything smooth, then season with salt.",
      "Heat a dry nonstick skillet over high heat, then add the butter. Let it melt and foam, but not brown.",
      "Pour in the eggs and leave them untouched for 3 seconds, until the rim starts to bubble.",
      "Take the skillet off the burner and stir in circles, one lap per second, for 11–12 seconds. Stop when the butter is absorbed but the eggs look slightly wet.",
